# Derived build outputs. `qpdewatch build` regenerates all of these offline in
# seconds from data/corpus.jsonl, so committing them would add megabytes to the
# history every week for no recoverable information. The corpus, the config and
# the code are the source of truth; everything here is a function of them.
# The site is published by .github/workflows/weekly.yml via the Pages artifact,
# not from a committed copy.
data/corpus.csv
data/coverage_matrix_counts.csv
data/coverage_matrix_fraction.csv
data/gap_scorecard.csv
docs/index.html
docs/coverage_matrix.png
docs/gap_trajectory.png

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.tmp
*.jsonl.tmp
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
